We are fast approaching Spring and saying good-bye to the New England Winter.&nbsp; And with that comes the planning for the next school year, and for the Red Cross, finding new sponsors to work with for the 2018-19 school year.&nbsp; We are committed to providing a great learning experience with our school programs for the students, faculty, and parents, that also creates a wonderful opportunity to grow the community involvement atmosphere and help develop the leaders of tomorrow.&nbsp; I look forward to speaking with you and looking toward our partnership.<br />
